[{"title":"丁宁吟","author":"邵雍","text":"人无忽略，事贵丁宁。\n忽略近薄，丁宁近诚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4017,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二说吟","author":"邵雍","text":"治不变俗，教不易民。\n甘龙之说，亦或可循。\n常人习俗，学者溺闻。\n商鞅之说，异乎所云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4018,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人事吟","author":"邵雍","text":"人有去就，事无低昂；迹有疏密，人无较量。\n能此四者，自然久长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4019,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人事吟","author":"邵雍","text":"人无取次，事莫因循。\n因循失事，取次坏人。\n人无率尔，事贵丁宁。\n率尔近薄，丁宁近诚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4020,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人情吟","author":"邵雍","text":"人达人情，无寡无广。\n天下之事，如指诸掌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4021,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"力外吟","author":"邵雍","text":"以少为多，以无为有。\n力外周旋，不能长久。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4022,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"力穑吟","author":"邵雍","text":"春时耕种，夏时耘耨。\n秋时收治，冬时用受。\n雨露不愆，既苗既秀。\n水旱为灾，尚罹其咎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4023,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上下吟","author":"邵雍","text":"自下观上，无限富贵。\n自上观下，无限贱贫。\n自心观物，何物能一。\n自物观心，何心不均。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4024,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久旱吟","author":"邵雍","text":"久旱望雨，久雨思晴。\n天之常道，人之常情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4025,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天时吟","author":"邵雍","text":"人作者事，天命者时。\n时来易失，事去难追。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4026,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义利吟","author":"邵雍","text":"意不若义，义不若利。\n利之使人，能忘生死。\n利不若义，义不若意。\n意之使人，能动天地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4027,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义利吟","author":"邵雍","text":"贲于丘园，束帛戋戋。\n义既在前，利在其间。\n舍尔灵龟，观我朵颐。\n义既失之，利何能为。\n尚义必让，君子道长。\n尚利必争，小人道行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4028,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义利吟","author":"邵雍","text":"君子尚义，小人尚利。\n尚利则乱，尚义则治。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4029,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"土木偶人","author":"邵雍","text":"土木偶人，慎无相笑。\n天将大雨，止可相吊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4030,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大易吟","author":"邵雍","text":"天地定位，否泰反类。\n山泽通气，损咸见义。\n雷风相薄，恒益起意。\n水火相射，既济未济。\n四象相交，成十六事。\n八卦相荡，为六十四。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4031,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大笔吟","author":"邵雍","text":"有客无知，为性太质。\n不忮不求，无固无必。\n足蹑天根，手探月窟。\n所得之怀，尽赋于笔。\n意远情融，气和神逸。\n酒放微醺，绡铺半匹。\n如风之卒，如云之勃。\n如电之欻，如雨之密。\n或往或还，或没或出。\n涤荡氛埃，廓开天日。\n鸾凤翱翔，龙蛇盘屈。\n春葩暄妍，秋山崒屼。\n三千簪裾，俯循儒术。\n百万貔貅，仰听军律。\n松桂成林，芝兰满室。\n蜀锦初番，朝霞乍拂。\n白璧一双，黄金百镒。\n羲之来求，牧之来乞。\n物外神交，人间事毕。\n观者析醒，收之愈疾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4032,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小人吟","author":"邵雍","text":"小人无耻，重利轻死。\n不畏人诛，岂顾物议。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4033,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小人吟","author":"邵雍","text":"小人无节，弃本逐末。\n喜思其与，怒思其夺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4034,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小车吟","author":"邵雍","text":"有客无知，唯知有家。\n有家能归，其归非遐。\n灵台瑩静，天壤披葩。\n书用大笔，出乘小车。\n身为男子，生于中华。\n又居洛阳，为幸何多。\n天地中央，帝王贞宅。\n汉唐遗烈，气象自佳。\n圣贤区宇，士人渊薮。\n仁义场圃，闻见无涯。\n里巷相切，亲朋相过。\n人疑日驭，我谓星查。\n或游金谷，或泛月波。\n或经履道，或过铜驼。\n进退云水，舒卷烟霞。\n揄扬风月，抬帖莺花。\n性喜饮酒，饮喜微酡。\n饮未微酡，口先吟哦。\n吟哦不足，遂及浩歌。\n浩歌不足，无可奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4035,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小道吟","author":"邵雍","text":"艺虽小道，事亦系人。\n苟不造微，焉能入神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4036,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不再吟","author":"邵雍","text":"春无再至，花无再开。\n人无再少，时无再来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4037,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不同吟","author":"邵雍","text":"君子之人，与己非比。\n闻善则乐，见贤则喜。\n小人之人，与己非恶。\n闻善则憎，见贤则怒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4038,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不同吟","author":"邵雍","text":"求者不得，辞者不能。\n二者相去，其远几程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4039,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不肖吟","author":"邵雍","text":"不肖之人，志在游荡。\n身在屋下，心在屋上。\n不肖之子，志在浮誇。\n身尚不保，焉能保家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4040,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不知吟","author":"邵雍","text":"不知阴阳，不知天地。\n不知人情，不知物理。\n强为人师，宁不自愧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4041,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不善吟","author":"邵雍","text":"不良之人，禀气非正。\n蛇蝎其情，豺狼其性。\n至良之人，禀气清明。\n金玉其性，芝兰其情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4042,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中原吟","author":"邵雍","text":"中原之师，仁义为主。\n仁义既无，四夷来侮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4043,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书亡弟殡所","author":"邵雍","text":"后乎吾来，先乎吾往。\n当往之初，殊不相让。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4044,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六得吟","author":"邵雍","text":"眼能识得，耳能听得，口能道得，手能做得，身能行得，心能放得。\n六者尽能，与天同德。\n饮食起居，出处语默。\n不止省心，又更省力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4045,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内外吟 其一","author":"邵雍","text":"衣冠严整，谓之外修。\n行义纯洁，谓之内修。\n内外俱修，何人不求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4046,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内外吟 其二","author":"邵雍","text":"衣冠不整，谓之外惰。\n外义不修，谓之内惰。\n内外俱惰，何人不唾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4047,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"内外吟","author":"邵雍","text":"目耳鼻口，人之户牖。\n心胆脾肾，人之中霤。\n内若能守，外自不受。\n内若无守，外何能久。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4048,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天人吟","author":"邵雍","text":"天学修心，人学修身。\n身安心乐，乃见天人。\n天之与人，相去不远。\n不知者多，知之者鲜。\n身主于人，心主于天。\n心既不乐，身何由安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4049,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天命吟","author":"邵雍","text":"可委者命，可凭者天。\n人无率尔，事不偶然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4050,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"心迹吟","author":"邵雍","text":"圣人了心，贤人了迹。\n了心无穷，了迹无极。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4051,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文武吟","author":"邵雍","text":"既为文士，必有武备。\n文武之道，皆吾家事。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4052,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无妄吟","author":"邵雍","text":"耳无妄听，目无妄顾，口无妄言，心无妄虑。\n四者不妄，圣贤之具。\n予何人哉，敢不希慕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4053,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无疾吟","author":"邵雍","text":"无疾之安，无灾之福。\n举天下人，不为之足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4054,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无腼吟","author":"邵雍","text":"事曾经见，物曾持鍊。\n天地之间，俯仰无腼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4055,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水旱吟 其一","author":"邵雍","text":"尧水九年，汤旱七载。\n调燮之功，此时安在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4056,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水旱吟 其二","author":"邵雍","text":"九年洪水，七年大旱。\n非尧与汤，民死过半。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4057,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王公吟","author":"邵雍","text":"王公大人，天下具瞻；轻流薄习，重损威严。\n此尚未了，彼安能兼。\n非唯失道，又复起贪。\n顶戴儒冠，心存象教。\n本图心宁，复使心闹。\n譬如生子，当求克肖。\n不教义方，教之窃盗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4058,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"见义吟","author":"邵雍","text":"见善必为，不见则已。\n量力而动，力尽而止。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4059,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"去事吟","author":"邵雍","text":"君子去事，民有馀祥。\n小人去事，民有馀殃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4060,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四不可吟","author":"邵雍","text":"言不可妄，行不可隳。\n命不可忽，天不可违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4061,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四公子吟","author":"邵雍","text":"时去三王，事归五霸。\n七雄既争，四子乃诧。\n孟尝居先，信陵居亚。\n平原居中，春申居下。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4062,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四可吟","author":"邵雍","text":"可勉者行，可信者言。\n可委者命，可托者天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4063,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四者吟","author":"邵雍","text":"财色名势，为世所亲。\n四者不动，然后见人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4064,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"处身吟","author":"邵雍","text":"君子处身，宁人负己，己无负人。\n小人处事，宁己负人，无人负己。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4065,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正性吟","author":"邵雍","text":"未生之前，不知其然。\n既生之后，乃知有天。\n有天而来，止物之性。\n君子践形，小人轻命。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4066,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"民情吟","author":"邵雍","text":"民情既乐，和气为祥。\n民情既忧，戾气为殃。\n祥为雨露，天下丰穰。\n殃为水旱，天下凶荒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4067,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"由听吟","author":"邵雍","text":"由听而失，以听为宾。\n而今而后，何复信人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4068,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"名实吟","author":"邵雍","text":"内无是实，外有是名，小人故矜。\n外无是名，内有是实，君子何失。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4069,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"多多吟","author":"邵雍","text":"天下居常，害多于利。\n乱多于治，忧多于喜。\n奈何人生，不能免此。\n奈何予生，皆为外事。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4070,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"多事吟","author":"邵雍","text":"多事招忧，多疑招闷。\n多与招吝，多取招损。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4071,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"好胜吟","author":"邵雍","text":"人无好胜，事无过求。\n好胜多辱，过求多忧。\n忧辱并至，道德弗游。\n不止人患，身亦是仇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4072,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"好恶吟","author":"邵雍","text":"恶死好生，去害就利。\n天下之人，其情无异。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4073,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安分吟","author":"邵雍","text":"轻得易失，多谋少成。\n德无尽利，善无近名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4074,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安乐吟","author":"邵雍","text":"安乐先生，不显姓氏。\n垂三十年，居洛之涘。\n风月情怀，江湖性气。\n色斯其举，翔而后至。\n无贱无贫，无富无贵；无将无迎，无拘无忌。\n窘未尝忧，饮不至醉。\n收天下春，归之肝肺。\n盆池资吟，瓮牖荐睡。\n小车赏心，大笔快志。\n或戴接䍦，或著半臂；或坐林间，或行水际。\n乐见善人，乐闻善事；乐道善言，乐行善意。\n闻人之恶，若负芒刺；闻人之善，如佩兰蕙。\n不佞禅伯，不谀方士。\n不出户庭，直际天地。\n三军莫凌，万钟莫致。\n为快活人，六十五岁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4075,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"师资吟","author":"邵雍","text":"未知道义，寻人为师。\n既知道义，人来为资。\n寻师未易，为资实难。\n指南向道，非去非还。\n师人则耻，人师则喜。\n喜耻皆非，我独无是。\n好为人师，与耻何异。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4076,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"当断吟","author":"邵雍","text":"断以决疑，疑不可缓。\n当断不断，反受其乱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4077,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"成性吟","author":"邵雍","text":"成性存存，用志不分。\n又何患乎，不到古人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4078,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有时吟","author":"邵雍","text":"龙不冬跃，萤能夜飞。\n小人君子，而皆有时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4079,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有病吟","author":"邵雍","text":"身之有病，当求药医；药之非良，其身必亏。\n国之有病，当求人医；人之非良，其国必危。\n事之未急，当速改为；事之既急，虽悔难追。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4080,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"欢喜吟","author":"邵雍","text":"日往月来，终则有始。\n半行天上，半下地底。\n照临之间，不忧则喜。\n予何人哉，欢喜不已。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4081,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自作真赞","author":"邵雍","text":"松桂操行，莺花文才。\n江山气度，风月情怀。\n借尔面貌，假尔形骸。\n弄九馀暇，闲往闲来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4082,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自适吟","author":"邵雍","text":"郏鄏城中，凤凰楼下；风月庭除，莺花台榭。\n时和岁丰，闲行静坐；朋好身安，清吟雅话。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4083,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观物吟","author":"邵雍","text":"一气才分，两仪已备。\n圆者为天，方者为地。\n变化生成，动植类起。\n人在其间，最灵最贵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4084,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观物吟","author":"邵雍","text":"画工状物，经月经年。\n轩鉴照物，立写于前。\n鉴之为明，犹或未精。\n工出人手，平与不平。\n天下之平，莫若于水。\n止能照表，不能照里。\n表里洞照，其唯圣人。\n察言观行，罔或不真。\n尽物之性，去己之情。\n有德之人，而必有言。\n能言之人，未必能行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4085,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观物吟","author":"邵雍","text":"居暗观明，居静观动。\n居简观繁，居轻观重。\n所居者寡，所观则众。\n匪居匪观，众寡何用。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4086,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观物吟","author":"邵雍","text":"物不两盛，事难独行。\n荣瘁迭起，贤愚并行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4087,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观物吟","author":"邵雍","text":"如鸾如凤，意思安详。\n所生之人，非忠则良。\n如鼠如雀，意思惊躩；所生之人，不凶则恶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4088,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观物吟","author":"邵雍","text":"时有代谢，物有枯荣。\n人有衰盛，事有废兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4089,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邪正吟","author":"邵雍","text":"贤人好正，奸人好邪。\n好邪则竞，好正则和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4090,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"利害吟","author":"邵雍","text":"兔犬俱毙，蚌鹬相持。\n田渔老父，坐而利之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4091,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君子吟","author":"邵雍","text":"君子与义，小人与利；与义日兴，与利日废。\n君子尚德，小人尚力；尚德树恩，尚力树敌。\n君子作福，小人作威；作福福至，作威祸随。\n君子乐善，小人乐恶；乐恶恶至，乐善善归。\n君子好誉，小人好毁；好毁人怒，好誉人喜。\n君子思兴，小人思坏；思兴召祥，思坏召怪。\n君子好与，小人好求；好与多喜，好求多忧。\n君子好生，小人好杀；好生道行，好杀道绝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4092,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]